    "name": "ASSAULT SECTOR",
    "steam_appid": 1568600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/f959b643b44d6025c101272c2142702c.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are on a mission to solve one of the biggest issues in Multiplayer FPS - <strong>camping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to ASSAULT SECTOR, an old-school inspired PvP Arena Shooter with a revolutionary twist: <strong>PULSE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b2e3b51f65fdcacb2f8e54a03ff2d692.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In ASSAULT SECTOR, every player spawns with PULSE, which recharges through teamwork and combat. Camping is a thing of the past. Focus on hunting your enemies, strategizing with your team, and dominating the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/e3f945630b09baae6ddb91633f443ea2.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a versatile arsenal of gears, including <strong>ammo boxes</strong>, <strong>medkits</strong>, <strong>shields</strong>, <strong>transportation grenades</strong>, and <strong>tactical devices</strong>. Each item is designed to enhance combat, reveal enemies, and provide strategic advantages on the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/73f9d27832b8c19da4d0eed4c5e20733.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons are crucial in ASSAULT SECTOR, and we've ensured they feel silky smooth. Choose from <strong>Assault Rifles</strong>, <strong>SMGs</strong>, <strong>Sniper Rifles</strong>, <strong>DMRs</strong>, <strong>LMGs</strong>, <strong>Shotguns</strong>, and more. Customize your arsenal with a range of skins and attachments to match your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b7e31ba22ba9a50168a7854166fe2d88.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In ASSAULT SECTOR, you can choose from five distinct classes:\u00a0 <strong>CLONE</strong> | <strong>CYBER</strong> | <strong>INFANTRY</strong> | <strong>DARK-OPS</strong> | <strong>RECON</strong><br>Each class offers specific perks, gadgets, and unique abilities. Whether you prefer aggressive, stealth, defensive, or ranged gameplay, we have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/c555840b6186d9ed99bb0384d088d402.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d87d61b202cdf6125a8eaf1aff13c588.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/bb640b988fdcae0008c26c9c987ec943.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d8752a0ff6cdb08da7d8b8d809936ecb.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d33f9524d298d5e2ce0499bf7549a597.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/1cc16f8473d926b1ecdfe52b81cf93af.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience intense action with four distinct game modes, each offering unique challenges and strategic gameplay. Whether outmaneuvering opponents or engaging in all-out combat, every mode delivers a fresh experience for different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b35a630d22caab1023285adc0cdad4e5.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/9b908c3e8b24a97a94b7028b6484f4ee.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ASSAULT SECTOR will evolve over time. While it may not be a feature-complete, AAA game at launch, we're committed to continuous improvement. Game development is a challenging and labor-intensive process, and we invite you to join us on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please <strong>join our <u>Discord</u></strong> or <strong>follow us on <u>Twitter</u></strong> to share your feedback. If you like what you see, <u><strong>Wishlist</strong></u><strong> us on Steam</strong> to support our ongoing improvements. Be part of our growing community and help us build the best game possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/c22eab61ed84feb1e56f8ad4d5471227.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PREPARE FOR BATTLE, CONQUER THE SECTOR!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/f959b643b44d6025c101272c2142702c.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are on a mission to solve one of the biggest issues in Multiplayer FPS - <strong>camping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to ASSAULT SECTOR, an old-school inspired PvP Arena Shooter with a revolutionary twist: <strong>PULSE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d0fffa4ac3f31ba69f230ede84aa2a8e.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b2e3b51f65fdcacb2f8e54a03ff2d692.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In ASSAULT SECTOR, every player spawns with PULSE, which recharges through teamwork and combat. Camping is a thing of the past. Focus on hunting your enemies, strategizing with your team, and dominating the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/0373dfb9278162c182689877ea506305.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/e3f945630b09baae6ddb91633f443ea2.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a versatile arsenal of gears, including <strong>ammo boxes</strong>, <strong>medkits</strong>, <strong>shields</strong>, <strong>transportation grenades</strong>, and <strong>tactical devices</strong>. Each item is designed to enhance combat, reveal enemies, and provide strategic advantages on the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fe52494e7da84d8de8ffcbf8fcf5df9e.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/73f9d27832b8c19da4d0eed4c5e20733.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons are crucial in ASSAULT SECTOR, and we've ensured they feel silky smooth. Choose from <strong>Assault Rifles</strong>, <strong>SMGs</strong>, <strong>Sniper Rifles</strong>, <strong>DMRs</strong>, <strong>LMGs</strong>, <strong>Shotguns</strong>, and more. Customize your arsenal with a range of skins and attachments to match your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/6768c5e42bbb64774a2fe746884775ce.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b7e31ba22ba9a50168a7854166fe2d88.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In ASSAULT SECTOR, you can choose from five distinct classes:\u00a0 <strong>CLONE</strong> | <strong>CYBER</strong> | <strong>INFANTRY</strong> | <strong>DARK-OPS</strong> | <strong>RECON</strong><br>Each class offers specific perks, gadgets, and unique abilities. Whether you prefer aggressive, stealth, defensive, or ranged gameplay, we have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/c555840b6186d9ed99bb0384d088d402.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d87d61b202cdf6125a8eaf1aff13c588.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/bb640b988fdcae0008c26c9c987ec943.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d8752a0ff6cdb08da7d8b8d809936ecb.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/d33f9524d298d5e2ce0499bf7549a597.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/1cc16f8473d926b1ecdfe52b81cf93af.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience intense action with four distinct game modes, each offering unique challenges and strategic gameplay. Whether outmaneuvering opponents or engaging in all-out combat, every mode delivers a fresh experience for different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b35a630d22caab1023285adc0cdad4e5.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/9b908c3e8b24a97a94b7028b6484f4ee.webp?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ASSAULT SECTOR will evolve over time. While it may not be a feature-complete, AAA game at launch, we're committed to continuous improvement. Game development is a challenging and labor-intensive process, and we invite you to join us on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please <strong>join our <u>Discord</u></strong> or <strong>follow us on <u>Twitter</u></strong> to share your feedback. If you like what you see, <u><strong>Wishlist</strong></u><strong> us on Steam</strong> to support our ongoing improvements. Be part of our growing community and help us build the best game possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.poster.avif?t=1740441159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.webm?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/72d9573e1498b22ec61ed15e9c57c298.mp4?t=1740441159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/c22eab61ed84feb1e56f8ad4d5471227.avif?t=1740441159\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PREPARE FOR BATTLE, CONQUER THE SECTOR!</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to a brutal and unforgiving PvP arena shooter. With the unique PULSE wallhack ability, camping is impossible, keeping the action fast, intense, and relentless. It\u2019s pure adrenaline. A true throwback to the &quot;golden-era&quot; of classic FPS games. Think you have what it takes? Jump in and find out.",
